   "description": "<h2>Fontaine’s FOV Fix v4.1.0 for SPT 4.1.x</h2>\n<h3>Tweaks &amp; Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Added config option to modify max freelook rotation (thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Elmer-Glue\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Elmer-Glue</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed camera recoil being modified by this mod inadvertently</li>\n<li>Fixed the FOV Scale option being reset every raid</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Known Issues:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Thermals are no longer variable due to BSG’s changes.</li>\n<li>FOV/zoom between scopes of the same magnification is not consistent due to BSG.</li>\n</ul>\n",
